# Formspree form ID that powers the Contact page submit handler.
#
# Setup:
# 1. Create a free account at https://formspree.io
# 2. Create a new form and set its notification email to
#    b.ashkenazy@redapt.com (the free plan allows a second linked
#    notification address in the dashboard — add pspikes@redapt.com
#    there too; the form also CCs it directly via a hidden field as
#    a backup, see src/pages/Contact.tsx)
# 3. Copy the form ID from the endpoint Formspree gives you
#    (https://formspree.io/f/XXXXXXXX -> the XXXXXXXX part)
# 4. Put it below, then copy this file to .env.local (gitignored)
#    for local dev, and set it as an environment variable in your
#    hosting platform (Vercel/Netlify/etc.) for production.
VITE_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=your_form_id_here
